      "created_at": "2017-09-12T14:38:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, this was a trivial Mint for me. It only lasted as long as it did because all of the Relics were toward the bottom of the deck...</p><p>...which I'm now realizing might have helped things go faster, given SST's ability. I kept using it on Wraith! Should have used it to throw more of Gloomy's cards away.&nbsp;<span>D'oh.</span></p><p>Still. Mint.</p>",
