      "created_at": "2017-09-12T16:19:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Man, that would have been a good idea. I rarely find myself using SST's ability on anyone but herself since it's sort of a crap shoot. Tachyon at least gets something out of the discarded cards. Though Arcane Cadence let me setup a few plays in this game since I knew what was at the bottom of the deck. Hmmm, and I probably could have used Infrared Eye to do the same thing with the villain deck, too.</p>",
