      "id": 203487,
      "name": "mightyschoop",
      "username": "mightyschoop",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-09-12T22:42:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Beat the living tar out of GloomWeaver. I was able to get my favorite setup with wraith very quickly thanks to the game giving me an impromptu invention, targetinging computer, and the razor ordnance in my opening hand. Used Visionary to keep Tachyon with enough cards to play, and experimented on Tachyon's own deck every turn. AA was handing out a lot of card plays.&nbsp;</p><p>I managed to drop 3 11 points Lightspeed barrages on gloomweaver on the same turn. That was fun.</p>",
